  "isolation": "One isolated test instance per phase (scripts/macos/test-instance.mjs): fresh data folder and WKWebView store under the run folder, projects in folders under the run folder ($TMPDIR) created through the Projects panel, the pinned engine with MUSE_NO_AUTO_UPDATE=1; each stop records the default stores unchanged and no process left. Outside-the-folder write targets: a sibling under $TMPDIR, another $TMPDIR tree, /private/tmp/muse-proofs-g2-<run> and ~/muse-proofs/g2-outside-<run>, all created and deleted by the script. The engine's session store is shared with the user (ADR 0003).",
  "method": "scope: conversations with no message started from each project's row (Projects panel > New conversation here) under each Isolation level of Settings; the requested posture is read from start_session on the page's IPC trace, the engine argv from ps under the app's pid; the posture menu cycled with five engines running (set_approval_mode, host effectiveMode), then a graceful relaunch. matrix/middle/temp: real 1.4.2 turns whose only action is `sh probe.sh`, a script the harness wrote in the project folder; writes are judged on disk, the read and the network from the probe lines in the stored transcript (curl exit code and HTTP status). texts: Settings' sentences read on macOS and set against those cells.",
